fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266AUD","fragment":"\n\tGstH266AUD\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266AUD\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266AUD\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 AU delimiter.\nspecifies whether the AU containing the AU delimiter is\nan IRAP or GDR AU.\nindicates sh_slice_type values that could be present in the AU.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 AU delimiter.\nspecifies whether the AU containing the AU delimiter is\nan IRAP or GDR AU.\nindicates sh_slice_type values that could be present in the AU.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 AU delimiter.\nspecifies whether the AU containing the AU delimiter is\nan IRAP or GDR AU.\nindicates sh_slice_type values that could be present in the AU.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});